 Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.133333px; text-indent: -28.4px; font-size: 12pt;\">◦</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.133333px; text-indent: -28.4px; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">경상북도의 기후변화 대응계획을 기초로 한 </span><b><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">주요 분야(에너지, 산업, 수송, 건물, 폐기물, 농업·축산·수산)&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">온실가스 감축 핵심 계획의 </span><b><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">적합성 및 감축 목표 실현 가능성 평가</span></b><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">를 통한 실질적 온실가스 감축 계획 수립</span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 2em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.133333px; text-indent: -28.4px; font-size: 12pt;\">◦</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.133333px; text-indent: -28.4px; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">탄소중립 구축 모델 개발을 통한 </span><b><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">분야별 추진계획 수립</span></b><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">, 주요 성과지표 달성 및 감축 목표 구체화 방안 모색</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.133333px; text-indent: -28.4px; font-size: 12pt;\">◦</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.133333px; text-indent: -28.4px; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">분야별 </span><b><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">핵심 정책 및 모델 확산 방안 제시</span></b><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">를 통한 경상북도 2050 탄소중립 전략적 기반 마련</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.133333px; text-indent: -28.4px; font-size: 12pt;\">◦</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.133333px; text-indent: -28.4px; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><b>탄소중립˙녹색성장 기본계획('23. 3월) 검토</b> 등</span><br><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">□ 지원 내용</span></b></p><p style=\"margin-left: 2em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.133333px; text-indent: -28.4px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">◦ 지원기간 :&nbsp;</span></span></span><b style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.133333px; text-indent: -28.4px;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">2022년 12월 21일(수) ~ 2023년 4월 30일(금)</span></u></b><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.133333px; text-indent: -28.4px;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.133333px; text-indent: -28.4px; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">◦ 지원비 : </span><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">￦10,000,000원(금일천만원, 부가세 제외)</span></b></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; text-indent: -28.4px; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 2em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.133333px; text-indent: -28.4px; font-size: 12pt;\">◦ 공모내용(계획사업 예시)</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; text-indent: -28.4px; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 4em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">- (</span><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">에너지 분야</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">)태양광, 풍력, 지열 보급 등</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 4em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">- (</span><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">산업 분야</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">)스마트 그린 산단 조성 등</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 4em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">- (</span><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">수송 분야</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">)친환경 전기차 보급 등</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 4em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">- (</span><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">건물 분야</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">)그린리모델링 지원 등</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 4em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">- (</span><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">폐기물 분야</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">)생활 폐기물 감량화 등</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 4em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">- (</span><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">농˙축˙수산</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">)농기계 조기 폐차 등</span></span><br><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">※ </span><u><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">상기 사업내용 외의 제안도 가능함.</span></u></span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 4em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">□ 신청자격</span></b></p><p style=\"margin-left: 2em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.133333px; text-indent: -28.4px; font-size: 12pt;\">◦ 사업자등록증상의 기업 주소가 경상북도 소재 기업 소속 전문가</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; text-indent: -28.4px; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;\"><br></span></b></p><p style=\"margin-left: 2em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.133333px; text-indent: -28.4px; font-size: 12pt;\">◦ 사업자등록증상 학술 또는 연구용역 관련 기관 및 대학 소속 전문가</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.133333px; text-indent: -28.4px;\"><br></span></b></p><p style=\"margin-left: 2em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.133333px; text-indent: -28.4px;\"><br></span></p><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">□ 신청기간 및 방법</span></b></p><p style=\"margin-left: 2em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.133333px; text-indent: -28.4px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">◦ 접수기간 :&nbsp;</span><b><u><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 1